{"id":193,"date":"2009-05-23T13:51:09","date_gmt":"2009-05-23T13:51:09","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/?p=193"},"modified":"2015-04-24T23:20:19","modified_gmt":"2015-04-24T22:20:19","slug":"resolution-de-systemes-dequations-lineaires-avec-un-tableur","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/2009\/05\/23\/resolution-de-systemes-dequations-lineaires-avec-un-tableur\/","title":{"rendered":"R\u00e9solution de syst\u00e8mes d&#039;\u00e9quations lin\u00e9aires avec un tableur"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Besoin de r\u00e9soudre un <a href=\"http:\/\/www.dslimited.biz\/excel_tutorials\/simultaneouslinearequations.html\" target=\"_blank\">syst\u00e8me d&rsquo;\u00e9quations lin\u00e9aires<\/a> (N \u00e9quations \u00e0 N inconnues) rapidement ?<\/p>\n<p>Les tableurs les plus r\u00e9pandus peuvent vous aider !<\/p>\n<p>Avec Excel, tout est expliqu\u00e9<a href=\"http:\/\/www.dslimited.biz\/excel_tutorials\/simultaneouslinearequations.html\" target=\"_blank\"> ici en anglais<\/a> : on peut soit utiliser le \u00ab\u00a0solveur\u00a0\u00bb, soit les fonctions matricielles <a href=\"http:\/\/office.microsoft.com\/fr-ch\/excel\/HP052091791036.aspx\" target=\"_blank\">INVERSEMAT <\/a>et <a href=\"http:\/\/office.microsoft.com\/fr-ch\/excel\/HP052091811036.aspx\" target=\"_blank\">PRODUITMAT <\/a>(respectivement MINVERSE et MMULT en anglais) de fa\u00e7on toute simple :<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter\" src=\"http:\/\/www.dslimited.biz\/excel_tutorials\/images\/simultaneouslinearequations008.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"470\" height=\"160\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;\">Ces fonctions existent aussi dans le \u00ab\u00a0Calc\u00a0\u00bb d&rsquo;Open Office, mais limit\u00e9es \u00e0 25 \u00e9quations. (je ne connais pas la limite avec Excel)<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;\"><a href=\"http:\/\/docs.google.com\/support\/bin\/answer.py?hl=fr&amp;answer=82712\" target=\"_blank\">MINVERSE et MMULT<\/a> existent aussi parmi les<a href=\"http:\/\/docs.google.com\/support\/bin\/answer.py?hl=fr&amp;answer=71291\" target=\"_blank\"> fonctions tableau<\/a> du <a href=\"http:\/\/docs.google.com\/#\" target=\"_blank\">tableur de Google Docs<\/a>, sans limitation connue<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;\">D\u00e9cid\u00e9ment, ce tableur gratuit, puissant et en ligne n&rsquo;a plus grand chose \u00e0 envier \u00e0 ses anc\u00eatres &#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Besoin de r\u00e9soudre un syst\u00e8me d&rsquo;\u00e9quations lin\u00e9aires (N \u00e9quations \u00e0 N inconnues) rapidement ? Les tableurs les plus r\u00e9pandus peuvent<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":37,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"colormag_page_container_layout":"default_layout","colormag_page_sidebar_layout":"default_layout","footnotes":""},"categories":[166],"tags":[48,50,58,63],"class_list":["post-193","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-microclub","tag-excel","tag-google-docs","tag-maths","tag-open-office"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/193","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/37"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=193"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/193\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1763,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/193\/revisions\/1763"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=193"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/micr